cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Vörður"
abstract: >-
  Deterministic security controls in the application around an LLM:
  provenance labeling and isolation of untrusted content, prompt-injection
  detection, tool authorization and request binding, outbound data-loss
  prevention, and a privacy vault, all local and with no external API calls.
